-- =====================================================================
--  GenbaGo — demo seed  (DDS-14 §9; TEST-14 TC-005)
--  Reproduces SRS-14 Appendix A and AC-02…AC-09 through the real functions and triggers. Generated by seed14.py,
--  which also re-derives every expected value with the Python twins; PostgreSQL itself was not executed on the
--  authoring machine (README-14 "Verification"). The 16 probes at the end must each FAIL inside their transaction.
--
--  J1  Appendix A JA→TH (and J1E JA→EN): TM miss → glossary-constrained MT → clean checks → interpretation
--      injection_molding / problem_report, confidence 0.91, 5 curated checks, 4 indexed documents (AC-04, AC-08, AC-09)
--  J2  the same input after J1's approval → exact TM reuse, no model call (AC-07)
--  J3  8D report TH→JA, 12 segments: ±0.05 mm / 3.2 mm / LOT-2609-114 preserved (AC-02); 3.2 → 3.5 blocked;
--      修正措置 flagged as forbidden (AC-03); an omitted sentence flagged; a fuzzy TM candidate; edits with distances;
--      11 approved → TM; #12 left needs_review
--  J4  photo of a vertical 検査基準書: OCR regions, one handwritten note low-confidence, side-by-side result (AC-06)
--  J5  不良品は現場で処理してください → three readings, confidence 0.55 (AC-05)
--  J6  batch of 5 files, one failed and resumed (FR-20, NFR-07)   J7  HMI screenshot with layout kept (FR-19)
--  JD  a non-confidential Discord /jp request (IF-08)   + a 40-segment versioned test set with three evaluation runs
-- =====================================================================
